      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140616_11151883_0622&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140616_11151883_0622.jpg&#34;&gt; &lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140616_11153105_0623&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140616_11153105_0623.jpg&#34;&gt;From: J.T.W., To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Hannibal, MO. on August 17, 1912&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bessie Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Lousiana, MO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dear Miss B.,&lt;br&gt;
I was delighted to hear from you. I’m living here by Gump. You think I’m a liar but I’m not. It just happened.&lt;br&gt;
J.T.W.&lt;br&gt;
2108 Midtown St.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
